Under the Regulation, an **"AI system"** means a machine-based system that:

- is designed to operate with varying levels of autonomy, and may show adaptiveness after it has been deployed [1];
- for explicit or implicit objectives, infers from the input it receives how to generate outputs — such as predictions, content, recommendations, or decisions [1];
- can influence physical or virtual environments through those outputs [1].

This is the exact wording given in the definitions section of the Regulation [1].
